        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dee-bid kɛnɛ Bɛ̈th-cɛba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ thuɔ̱k runä, gua̱a̱th in la kua̱r a nyiëëny, cu Dee-bid Yo-ab kɛnɛ ji̱ kɔarɛ ja̱k kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal kä cukɛ ji̱ Am-on wä däk, kä cua Rɛ̈-baa wä go̱l. Duundɛ ɣöö cu Dee-bid duɔth kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ tuɔ̱k kɛ cäŋ kɛl kɛ thiaŋ, cu Dee-bid rɔ jiɛc wi̱i̱ dhaŋädɛ jälɛ wi̱i̱ duëël kuäärädɛ, cuɛ ciek nɛn wi̱i̱ duëël puakɛ. Kä ɛ ciek mi gɔaa ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Dee-bid raan ja̱k kɛ ɣöö bɛ jɛ wä ŋa̱c. Kä cu ram kɛl wee i̱, “/Ciɛ Bɛ̈th-cɛba, nya Ɛ-li-am ciek U-ri-yaa raan Ɣɛ̈th inu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Dee-bid naath ja̱k. Kä cua jɛ wä no̱o̱ŋ. Cuɛ ben kä jɛ, kä cuɛ tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ jɛ. (Kä jɛn pay thuɔ̱k ni buɔthdɛ.) Kä cuɛ loc dhɔrɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ciek ruët. Kä cuɛ Dee-bid jäk kä raan i̱, “Ruëtdä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid Yo-ab jäk kä raan i̱, “Jäk ni ɣä kä U-ri-yaa raan Ɣɛ̈th.” Kä cu Yo-ab ɛ jäk kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci U-ri-yaa ben kä jɛ, cuɛ thiec kɛ ta̱a̱ Yo-ab, kɛnɛ ta̱a̱ nath, kɛ ta̱a̱ in tekɛ ko̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ U-ri-yaa ku jiök i̱, “Wër dhɔru, bi wä lɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ.” Cu U-ri-yaa jiɛɛn dhɔr kua̱r, kä guɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛ jɛ ɛ raan dhɔaar kua̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö U-ri-yaa Cuɛ niɛɛn thok dhɔaar kua̱r kɛɛl kɛ ja̱a̱ŋ kua̱rɛ, /kenɛ wä dhɔrɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ca la̱r Dee-bid i̱, “/Ken U-ri-yaa wä dhɔrɛ,” cuɛ U-ri-yaa jiök i̱, “Ci bä jäl inu? Ɛŋu /keni wä dhɔru mɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Dee-bid loc i̱, “Thanduk matdä ruac kɛnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kɛ ji̱ Juda cieŋkɛ rɛy bilɛ ni. Kä te kuäärä ni Yo-ab kɛnɛ ji̱ kɔar kua̱rä rɛy ka̱a̱ni. A dëë ku wä dhɔrä, wa̱a̱ mi̱th kä ma̱thä, kä tɔ̱a̱cä kɛ ciekdä? Ce̱tnikɛ mɔ tëki mɔ, /cä kɛn ti̱ti̱ bi la̱t.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid U-ri-yaa jiök i̱, “Teni wa̱nɛ ɛn walɛ, kä i̱ ruun bä ji̱ jak kä wä.” Inɔ cu U-ri-yaa te kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ ni̱n da̱ŋ rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ cio̱l mi̱eth. Cukɛ mi̱th kɛɛl kä cukɛ math, kä cuɛ jɛ jak kä yɔŋ. Kɛ thiaŋ cuɛ wä wee tɔ̱ɔ̱c rɛy pa̱ta̱nädɛ kɛnɛ ja̱a̱ŋ kua̱rɛ, /kenɛ wä dhɔrɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ runwaŋ cu Dee-bid Yo-ab gɔa̱r warɛgak kä cuɛ jɛ ja̱k kɛ tet U-ri-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn rɛy warɛgakä cɛ gɔ̱r i̱, “Jäk ni U-ri-yaa nhiam ko̱o̱r mi ci leeth, kä kua rɔ yuɔ̱th jɔk kä a jɛ na̱kɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ gua̱th in go̱l Yo-ab wec, cuɛ U-ri-yaa jäk kä waaŋ ko̱o̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ wec ben raar cukɛ ben nyiëëny kɛ Yo-ab. Cua tha̱a̱ŋ nɛɛni Dee-bid näk, amäni U-ri-yaa cua näk bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-ab Dee-bid la̱t thuk ko̱o̱r diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jääk jiök i̱, “Mi wi̱i̱ wä thuɔ̱k kɛ lät kua̱r thuk diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi kuäär gaak kɛ ji̱, kä bɛ ji̱ jiök i̱, ‘Ɛŋu /cuarɛ rɔ ti̱ec puɔ̱ny wec ɔ? Dëë yɛn ɛ kui̱c ɛn ɣöö ba Yɛ ba̱r puɔ̱ny pa̱ny? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋa mi näk Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk gat Yɛ-ru-bɛ-cɛth? Kä /ciɛ ciek ɛn nëë ci pil yuɔr wi̱i̱dɛ kɛ wi̱c pa̱ny, kä cuɛ cu li̱w kä Te-bedh? Ɛŋu wä yɛn thiekä pa̱ny ɔ?’ Kä bi cu wee i̱, ‘Ci ja̱ŋdu ni U-ri-yaa raan Ɣɛ̈th li̱w bä.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu jääk ben cuɛ Dee-bid ben la̱t tin diaal tin ci Yo-ab ɛ ja̱k kɛ kɛ i̱ bɛ ben lat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk Dee-bid jiök i̱, “Kɛn naath ca nɛy tiam a cukɛ ben raar kä nɛy jɔk wec. Duundɛ ɣöö cua̱kɔ kɛ nyɔk kɛ joc ni rɛy wec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cua nɛy ba̱r kɛ bääri rɛy pa̱nyni. Ɛ ca tha̱a̱ŋ nɛɛniku näk. Amäni ja̱ŋdu ni U-ri-yaa ca näk bä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ loc i̱, “Jio̱kni Yo-ab i̱, ‘Ɛ lɔcdu /ci jiäk, kɛ ɣöö ko̱r näkɛ nɛmɛ ɛn walɛ kä bɛ min dɔ̱ŋ näk iruun. Mäkni ni wec ɛ bum, amäni mi ciɛ ka̱n.’ Wër comɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
